// Russian (ru) designations for this guide's CodeSystems, as CodeSystem supplements.
// UNOFFICIAL: agent translation (official: false, generatedBy: agent); no person has signed it off.

CodeSystem: KeyUsageUATRu
Id: KeyUsage-UAT-ru
Title: "KeyUsage-UAT (ru designations, unofficial)"
Description: "Unofficial Russian designations for KeyUsage-UAT: an agent translation that no person has signed off."
